OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F386A1785062908
OL,3,CNearly #20m of cocaine seized in
OL,4,Cbanana shipment
OL,6,FAlmost #20m worth of cocaine has been
OL,7,Ffound, hidden in crates of bananas.
OL,8,FThe drugs were seized by the UK Border
OL,9,FForce after a cargo ship docked in
OL,10,FPortsmouth. It had set sail from South
OL,11,FAmerica via the Caribbean.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G1/3
