PN,38602
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F386A1785062908
OL,3,CNearly #20m of cocaine seized in
OL,4,Cbanana shipment
OL,6,FThe drugs, which have a street value
OL,7,Fof #19.2m, were hidden in crates of
OL,8,Fbananas onboard MV Atlantic Klipper.
OL,9,FThe National Crime Agency said it
OL,10,Fseized 240kg of the class A drug on
OL,11,FWednesday. With the support of the
OL,12,FJoint Operations Unit which comprises
OL,13,FHampshire Police and Thames Valley
OL,14,FPolice, the drugs were moved to a
OL,15,Fsecure location
OL,17,FMatteo Sole, NCA senior investigating
OL,18,Fofficer, said:
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G2/3
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
