FL,387,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38603
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F386A1785062908
OL,3,CNearly #20m of cocaine seized in
OL,4,Cbanana shipment
OL,6,F"This is a significant seizure of
OL,7,Fcocaine and will deprive the organised
OL,8,Fcrime group behind it of profit that
OL,9,Fcannot now fund further offending.
OL,11,F"The NCA works at home with partners
OL,12,Fsuch as Border Force, and abroad, to
OL,13,Fcombat the threat of Class A drugs and
OL,14,Fthe toxic effect they have on society."
OL,16,FThe investigation continues.
